Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,‎Ах... ха...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,‎ Ыстық... кесілгенде...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,‎Жеңілу... Жеңілу...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Кім? Мен?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,‎K…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах!
